---
/**
 * Preview of future community features. These are NOT working features:
 * there are deliberately no form fields, buttons or links that act on them.
 */
---

<section class="section coming" id="coming-soon" aria-labelledby="coming-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="coming-title">Shape the Kingdom</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        Soon, Zaunites will help decide what the kingdom becomes. These features are still being built and are{' '}
        <strong>not open yet</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="coming-grid">
      <article class="coming-card card reveal" aria-labelledby="suggest-title">
        <span class="badge badge--muted">Coming soon · Not open yet</span>
        <h3 id="suggest-title">Suggest an Upgrade</h3>
        <p>
          Propose new buildings, kingdom improvements, quests, events or website features. No account will be
          needed. Every suggestion will be read by the Royal Council before it appears publicly.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="coming-card card reveal" aria-labelledby="council-title">
        <span class="badge badge--muted">Coming soon · Not open yet</span>
        <h3 id="council-title">The Royal Council</h3>
        <p>
          Vote on selected kingdom decisions. Council votes will help guide future episodes, but the story's
          established history stays as it is.
        </p>
        <p class="example">
          <span class="example-label">Example question</span>
          “Should Zaun build homes or defences first?”
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section-lead strong {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .coming-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 52rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .coming-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .coming-card {
    padding: 22px;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
    align-content: start;
    justify-items: start;
    border-style: dashed;
    background: rgba(26, 16, 51, 0.55);
  }

  .coming-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .coming-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .example {
    font-style: italic;
    padding-left: 14px;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .example-label {
    display: block;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-faint);
  }
</style>
